  "name": "Courgette, Chilli and Mint Pearl Couscous",
  "subtitle": "A bright, savory couscous bowl with tender courgettes and fresh mint",
  "description": "Pearl couscous is paired with sautéed courgettes, onion, chilli, lemon, honey, mint, and salad cheese for a quick two-serving meal.",
